14
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:31,000
I just… I want us to stay this way.

15
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:37,000
[Meruem] How curious.
It would seem that this feeling,

16
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:46,000
a side effect of my current condition.

17
00:03:55,000 --> 00:03:57,000
and that means
you should be able to recover

18
00:03:57,000 --> 00:04:00,000
all of the memories you need.

19
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:05,000
I believe that the selection
was to begin at 12:00?

20
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:08,000
[Shaiapouf] Yes, sire.
However, it can be moved up

21
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:09,000
