22
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:19,000
[gasps]

23
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:20,000
What is it now?

24
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:21,000
[Shaiapouf] I haven't used my scales

25
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:24,000
on the humans
who are still on their way in.

26
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:32,000
and use them to hypnotize them.

27
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:34,000
What about you, Youpi?

28
00:04:34,000 --> 00:04:36,000
[groans]

29
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:37,000
Let me think.

30
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:40,000
-Guess I'll look for Pitou.
-[gasps]

31
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:48,000
Pitou.

32
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:51,000
[dramatic music playing]

33
00:04:58,000 --> 00:05:00,000
[Shaiapouf] Lord Meruem,

34
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:03,000
do you happen
to remember who Pitou is?

35
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:08,000
I do. One of my three
personal Royal Guards.

36
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:17,000
that I wouldn't
have remembered it before now.

37
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:24,000
Words can as well.

38
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:28,000
We cannot let him hear her name.

39
00:05:28,000 --> 00:05:30,000
We must be very careful.

40
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:50,000
[Meruem] There it is again.

41
00:05:52,000 --> 00:05:54,000
I'm counting on you, Pitou.

42
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:04,000
But what was it?

43
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:15,000
-Youpi.
-[Menthuthuyoupi] Sire?

44
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:17,000
Bring Pitou to me immediately.

45
00:06:17,000 --> 00:06:19,000
We have things to discuss.

46
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:20,000
Right.

47
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:22,000
And what will you do, Lord Meruem?

48
00:06:23,000 --> 00:06:26,000
I ask, because there are
still enemies around.

49
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:29,000
So there are.

50
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:31,000
I will go and search for Pitou myself

51
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:34,000
and hunt the stragglers in the process.

52
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:37,000
[Shaiapouf gasps] This is bad.

53
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:42,000
Uh, sire, that would be, uh…

54
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:45,000
It is merely for entertainment,

55
00:06:45,000 --> 00:06:48,000
and I am certain that they have
useful information.

56
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:51,000
[Shaiapouf] Perhaps,
but we won't be at your side,

57
00:06:57,000 --> 00:07:00,000
[dramatic music playing]

58
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:02,000
[Meruem] I want an honest answer, Pouf.

59
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:04,000
Give it.

60
00:07:04,000 --> 00:07:06,000
[gasping]

61
00:07:06,000 --> 00:07:08,000
In your personal opinion…

62
00:07:55,000 --> 00:07:58,000
Sire, Lord Meruem…

63
00:08:05,000 --> 00:08:08,000
[suspenseful music playing]

64
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:14,000
[narrator] The aura was overwhelming,

65
00:08:14,000 --> 00:08:17,000
and as it spread,
it filled Knuckle and the others

66
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:21,000
who were still in hiding
with abject despair.

67
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:33,000
to handle something of this magnitude.

68
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:36,000
Hey, Meleoron, let's run for it!

69
00:08:36,000 --> 00:08:37,000
Seriously?

70
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:39,000
You better believe it.

71
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:42,000
We'll just head back to the capital
under the cover of the crowd.

72
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:50,000
If they saw that, they'd understand.

73
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:52,000
They would run, too.

74
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:04,000
What if you and I were to team up?

75
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:07,000
[Knuckle] We could land
one attack on him, sure.

76
00:09:07,000 --> 00:09:09,000
And if we got really lucky,

77
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:13,000
we could probably
even attach A.P.R., but…

78
00:09:25,000 --> 00:09:27,000
do you really think we'd last long enough

79
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:29,000
for the King to go bankrupt?

80
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:33,000
Unless you've got the boss' lungs,
it ain't happening.

81
00:09:33,000 --> 00:09:36,000
Besides, the situation's changed.

82
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:38,000
It's not as clear-cut as it was before.

83
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:51,000
we should have notified the association

84
00:09:51,000 --> 00:09:53,000
so they could have
started working on plan B

85
00:09:54,000 --> 00:09:56,000
instead of wasting all this time.

86
00:09:56,000 --> 00:09:57,000
[grumbles]

87
00:09:57,000 --> 00:09:58,000
Hurry.

88
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:04,000
[narrator] Revenge versus duty.

89
00:10:04,000 --> 00:10:07,000
As they continued
to walk along in silence,

90
00:10:07,000 --> 00:10:08,000
the difference in their motives

91
00:10:08,000 --> 00:10:11,000
placed a growing distance between them.

92
00:10:24,000 --> 00:10:27,000
[dramatic music playing]

93
00:10:44,000 --> 00:10:48,000
before he could even think
to activate his power.

94
00:10:55,000 --> 00:10:57,000
[gasps]

95
00:10:57,000 --> 00:10:58,000
[Menthuthuyoupi] Where's the King?

96
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:19,000
There were two other Nen users there.

97
00:11:19,000 --> 00:11:21,000
I could sense their aura
reacting to my En,

98
00:11:29,000 --> 00:11:32,000
[Shaiapouf] One of them must be
carrying the unconscious Komugi.

99
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:34,000
That has to be where she went.

100
00:11:35,000 --> 00:11:38,000
What do I do? What do I do?

101
00:11:51,000 --> 00:11:52,000
[gasps]

102
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:56,000
It's just… If your purpose
is entertainment,

103
00:11:56,000 --> 00:11:58,000
