109
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:11,000
A game?

110
00:12:11,000 --> 00:12:13,000
[high-pitched whine]

111
00:12:19,000 --> 00:12:22,000
[dramatic music playing]

112
00:12:22,000 --> 00:12:25,000
-[high-pitched whine]
-[dramatic music playing]

113
00:12:25,000 --> 00:12:26,000
[Meruem] A game.

114
00:12:28,000 --> 00:12:29,000
A game.

115
00:12:35,000 --> 00:12:37,000
Youpi and I will both search for Pitou,

116
00:12:37,000 --> 00:12:41,000
and in the meantime, you look
for the two remaining Nen users.

117
00:12:42,000 --> 00:12:46,000
And we see who can
locate their target first, yes?

118
00:12:55,000 --> 00:12:58,000
I would like to make
a request of you, Lord Meruem.

119
00:12:58,000 --> 00:13:01,000
I ask that you wait here until I return.

120
00:13:01,000 --> 00:13:04,000
It is painfully obvious
that the difference in power

121
00:13:04,000 --> 00:13:07,000
