and the intruders is insurmountable.

122
00:13:28,000 --> 00:13:31,000
In addition, we ask
for one further handicap.

123
00:13:32,000 --> 00:13:35,000
"Further handicap"? What is it?

124
00:13:37,000 --> 00:13:40,000
You will only be permitted
to use your En once more.

125
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:42,000
How does that sound, sire?

126
00:13:43,000 --> 00:13:44,000
Mmm…

127
00:13:46,000 --> 00:13:48,000
It's quite amusing.

128
00:13:48,000 --> 00:13:49,000
[gasps]

129
00:13:50,000 --> 00:13:52,000
I like this game. I will accept.

130
00:13:52,000 --> 00:13:55,000
[Shaiapouf] Oh, thank you very much, sire.

131
00:13:55,000 --> 00:13:58,000
Perfect. With this development,

132
00:13:58,000 --> 00:14:01,000
I should have ample time
to kill that girl.

133
00:14:03,000 --> 00:14:05,000
And as long as all of us are playing,

134
00:14:11,000 --> 00:14:14,000
