with their target first.

165
00:16:26,000 --> 00:16:30,000
If Pitou should return while I'm gone,
you are to explain

166
00:16:39,000 --> 00:16:42,000
were an octopus and a human being,

167
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:45,000
