about Pitou and the girl?

171
00:17:10,000 --> 00:17:13,000
So where do you think Pitou ran off to?

172
00:17:13,000 --> 00:17:14,000
It's all right.

173
00:17:14,000 --> 00:17:16,000
Pitou should be back before long.

174
00:17:28,000 --> 00:17:30,000
so you really aren't buying us any time.

175
00:17:30,000 --> 00:17:33,000
Place your trust in me. I will not fail!

176
00:17:34,000 --> 00:17:35,000
Hmm.

177
00:17:35,000 --> 00:17:37,000
[dramatic music playing]

178
00:17:40,000 --> 00:17:42,000
[Palm panting]

179
00:17:44,000 --> 00:17:47,000
[Palm] Unbelievable. Such ferocious aura.

180
00:17:54,000 --> 00:17:57,000
They were only knocked unconscious.

181
00:17:57,000 --> 00:17:58,000
But where is Gon?

182
00:18:05,000 --> 00:18:09,000
No, those are the only
two figures in my crystal ball.

183
00:18:09,000 --> 00:18:10,000
That must be Gon.

184
00:18:10,000 --> 00:18:13,000
Something must have happened
when I wasn't watching.

185
00:18:13,000 --> 00:18:15,000
Where's Pitou?

186
00:18:15,000 --> 00:18:19,000
In any case,
don't come back here, please.

187
00:18:25,000 --> 00:18:26,000
Are they poisonous?

188
00:18:26,000 --> 00:18:29,000
It would be better for me
if he'd stay near the King.

189
00:18:30,000 --> 00:18:34,000
In any case,
he's on the other side of the palace.

190
00:18:34,000 --> 00:18:37,000
I must get as far
from my previous location as I can.

191
00:18:37,000 --> 00:18:41,000
After that wave of En,
I immediately used Wink Blue.

192
00:18:42,000 --> 00:18:45,000
As soon as I did,
the King appeared next to Pouf,

193
00:18:45,000 --> 00:18:47,000
carrying both Knuckle and Meleoron.

194
00:18:47,000 --> 00:18:50,000
Only a few seconds had passed.
I'm sure of it.

195
00:18:59,000 --> 00:19:01,000
I have to hurry and get even farther away

196
00:19:07,000 --> 00:19:09,000
I have to go in there.

197
00:19:09,000 --> 00:19:11,000
If I'm crossing the plain when he uses En,

198
00:19:11,000 --> 00:19:13,000
I won't be able to escape.

199
00:19:14,000 --> 00:19:16,000
If I'm deep underground,

200
00:19:16,000 --> 00:19:18,000
