201
00:19:19,000 --> 00:19:21,000
But I'm not giving myself an escape route.

202
00:19:22,000 --> 00:19:24,000
Should I stay outside
of the palace instead

203
00:19:37,000 --> 00:19:39,000
What should I do?

204
00:19:45,000 --> 00:19:46,000
Ikalgo!

205
00:19:46,000 --> 00:19:47,000
I figured you'd be here.

206
00:19:47,000 --> 00:19:50,000
Come on! Let's get inside! Hurry up!

207
00:19:50,000 --> 00:19:51,000
Yes, but how--

208
00:19:51,000 --> 00:19:54,000
Come on.
Isn't that why you came here?

209
00:19:54,000 --> 00:19:57,000
If he uses his En again, we're finished.

210
00:19:59,000 --> 00:20:00,000
[door whirring]

211
00:20:07,000 --> 00:20:09,000
They're together now.

212
00:20:09,000 --> 00:20:11,000
I don't know what happened to Pitou.

213
00:20:12,000 --> 00:20:14,000
[Ikalgo] Hmm.

214
00:20:19,000 --> 00:20:20,000
[dramatic music playing]

215
00:20:21,000 --> 00:20:22,000
[Ikalgo] I see.

216
00:20:22,000 --> 00:20:25,000
So Meleoron and Knuckle
were captured.

217
00:20:26,000 --> 00:20:29,000
The King is on a whole other level.

218
00:20:29,000 --> 00:20:30,000
[grunts]

219
00:20:44,000 --> 00:20:45,000
They're alive, huh?

220
00:20:46,000 --> 00:20:48,000
Probably so they can be traded.

221
00:21:01,000 --> 00:21:04,000
We need to hide the girl
in Bizeff's room.

222
00:21:52,000 --> 00:21:53,000
[Meruem] A game.

223
00:21:57,000 --> 00:21:59,000
A game.

224
00:21:59,000 --> 00:22:01,000
[closing theme music playing]

225
00:22:07,000 --> 00:22:10,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

226
00:23:31,000 --> 00:23:32,000
Killua.

227
00:23:32,000 --> 00:23:34,000
[Welfin] Don't you dare speak his name.
What do you know?

228
00:23:35,000 --> 00:23:37,000
Just who do you think you are? Huh?
